OL,3,GNEWSAAccused said he used knife in
OL,4,Aself-defence - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murder told police he
OL,7,Fpicked up the knife that caused the
OL,8,Ffatal injury in self-defence after the
OL,9,Fvictim threatened his partner, a court
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FJohn Robinson denies murder,
OL,13,Fmanslaughter and possessing a weapon in
OL,14,Fa public place after the death of Mason
OL,15,FJones in Burley in Wharfedale on 1
OL,16,FMarch.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
