OL,3,GNEWSAAccused said he used knife in
OL,4,Aself-defence - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fourth day of Robinson's trial at
OL,7,FBradford Crown Court heard he had
OL,8,Fpicked up the Japanese chef's knife in
OL,9,Fself-defence after Jones put his hands
OL,10,Faround his partner Annabel Ramsey's
OL,11,Fneck.
OL,13,FIn a police interview read to the
OL,14,Fcourt, Robinson, 30, said he had
OL,15,F"picked up the knife and told them to
OL,16,Fgo away", adding: "I stabbed him by
OL,17,Faccident."
